WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.034
-I also want to ask what you --

00:00:02.034 --> 00:00:03.236
You know,
because it's our 1,000th show --

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:04.637
Oh, that's beautiful.
That's a beautiful dress.

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:06.005
Can you tell me, is that --
did you -- have you worn --

00:00:06.005 --> 00:00:07.573
Where have you worn that?

00:00:07.573 --> 00:00:10.810
-This was from when
you hosted the "Golden Globes."

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:13.346
-Oh.
-Yay!

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:15.014
-Oh, it's so beautiful.

00:00:15.014 --> 00:00:18.084
How many more gowns do you have
since you and I met?

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:20.619
-I am not out, Seth.
I have plenty.

00:00:20.619 --> 00:00:23.055
I have some I haven't worn yet.

00:00:23.055 --> 00:00:24.390
[ Both laugh ]

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:25.692
I just love them.
-What do you miss the most --

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:28.828
What do you miss the most
about the office?

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:32.332
-About the office?

00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:36.569
Being with all of our
goofy friends.

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:39.305
-Yeah.
-I miss these people.

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:42.742
They're fun.
And we have little game nights.

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:44.610
-There are also nights where you

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:47.046
will make margaritas
for everybody.

00:00:47.046 --> 00:00:49.248
-Oh, yeah.
That's my favorite thing

00:00:49.248 --> 00:00:51.817
to do at the office
is make office margaritas.

00:00:51.817 --> 00:00:54.019
-And can you tell everybody
who's watching at home

00:00:54.019 --> 00:00:56.855
why I'm unable join you
for office margaritas?

00:00:56.855 --> 00:00:59.258
-Because office
margaritas happen

00:00:59.258 --> 00:01:01.827
during the taping of
"Late Night with Seth Meyers."

00:01:01.827 --> 00:01:03.296
[ Both laugh ]

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:05.932
-Just once it would be nice if
you waited until I was done!

00:01:05.932 --> 00:01:08.501
And by the way, I come back and
there's -- nobody's there.

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:10.936
Just a bunch
of lime juice on desks.

00:01:10.936 --> 00:01:13.873
-[ Laughs ]
-Disgusting.

00:01:13.873 --> 00:01:15.842
-It's a sticky place
to write, Seth.

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:17.510
-[ Laughs ]
It is a sticky place to write.

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:19.011
What do you miss least?

00:01:19.011 --> 00:01:26.219
-The thing I miss least is the
access to a butt-ton of food.

00:01:26.219 --> 00:01:28.621
-Oh, interesting.
-It's pretty wild.

00:01:28.621 --> 00:01:32.992
I am not kidding when I say
I have lost 10 pounds...

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:35.494
-Yeah.
-...by being at home.

00:01:35.494 --> 00:01:39.565
-I think, for me, the --
I bet the biggest drop for me

00:01:39.565 --> 00:01:42.068
the last three months
is just an intake of sodium.

00:01:42.068 --> 00:01:45.237
Because I eat so many -- like,
I'll just, like, get stressed --

00:01:45.237 --> 00:01:46.372
like, have writing stress

00:01:46.372 --> 00:01:48.140
and just go eat
a handful of pretzels.

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:51.143
-Yeah.
-And, uh...yeah.

00:01:51.143 --> 00:01:53.345
So, you're right.
I didn't think about that,

00:01:53.345 --> 00:01:55.748
but that's a really nice --
nice part of this.

00:01:55.748 --> 00:01:58.317
-Yeah.
I can't wait to go back there,

00:01:58.317 --> 00:02:01.587
balloon up, break out.
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:01.587 --> 00:02:04.590
-I can't wait.

00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:07.593
-Amber, can you believe
it's been 1,000 shows?

00:02:07.593 --> 00:02:09.561
-I can't believe
it's been 1,000 shows.

00:02:09.561 --> 00:02:11.297
Congratulations, Seth!

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:12.865
-And to you, Amber.

00:02:12.865 --> 00:02:15.634
It was all -- all the better
for having you with us.

00:02:15.634 --> 00:02:17.369
And, oh!
This is really exciting.

00:02:17.369 --> 00:02:18.604
-What?
-I can't believe

00:02:18.604 --> 00:02:20.038
I almost forgot this.
Because a lot of people

00:02:20.038 --> 00:02:23.142
have been tweeting at me
that I should give you my show,

00:02:23.142 --> 00:02:26.279
because they are so enamored
with you and less so with me.

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:29.515
And that's fair.
But you do --

00:02:29.515 --> 00:02:32.685
You are gonna be doing a show
on Peacock,

00:02:32.685 --> 00:02:34.353
the new NBC streaming service.

00:02:34.353 --> 00:02:36.356
-"The Amber Ruffin Show."
-Yeah.

00:02:36.356 --> 00:02:39.459
-It's coming to you.
And it's gonna happen.

00:02:39.459 --> 00:02:42.695
When? Well, we've hit a hitch,
haven't we?

00:02:42.695 --> 00:02:45.999
But as soon as things clear out,
we're coming to get you guys.

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:47.533
-And that's so exciting.
And it should be noted

00:02:47.533 --> 00:02:49.202
that's something --
I do want to give credit

00:02:49.202 --> 00:02:52.438
to the network because
this is something

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:54.740
that's been in the works
for almost a year now.

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:57.009
And they wisely
recognized your talent,

00:02:57.009 --> 00:03:00.513
and I'm so excited for that --
that chapter for you, as well.

00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:03.082
Thank you for spending
this chapter with us.

00:03:03.082 --> 00:03:04.951
I love you so much,
and I will see you soon.

00:03:04.951 --> 00:03:06.752
-I love you more!
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:06.752 --> 00:03:08.120
-Happy 1,000!

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:10.256
-Do you love me more
than Anderson?

00:03:10.256 --> 00:03:12.825
-Yes!
-Oh, thank you.

00:03:12.825 --> 00:03:14.894
[ Laughs ]

